{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_900.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"12c3f525f60eff121988bf389fa44853b8d3a21ae7c09be172a067c76698bc1d","ja":"ふんふふ～ん……♪","zh":"哼哼哼～……♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_900.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"4ae08d1f0d36f490d49fd4c198d70312f4183d495682285431802dc0f6989a0b","ja":"ふぅ～、今日もレッスン疲れた～。……って、あれ？\n翼、今日はもう、お仕事終わったんじゃなかったの？","zh":"呼～，今天的训练也累死我了～。……咦？翼，你今天的工作不是已经结束了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_900.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"ad8418504c1b958c767d842298b7c20418a2f9b011491c6d4ff6eeaff83be752","ja":"あ、恵美さん！　待ってたんですよ～♪\nこの後、みんなでお菓子パーティしませんか？","zh":"啊，惠美！我一直在等你呢～♪\n之后要不要一起举办零食派对？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_900.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d452acdf697e352f38a15814f4a788f3db47ba47937d0db850612d2cab7fa888","ja":"お菓子パーティ？\nアタシはオッケーだけど……どしたの、急に？","zh":"零食派对？\n我倒是没问题……怎么了，突然提这个？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_900.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"95bf386052c5225976aca6a81ad6599a6b53e5167e0dc063820caaab8c6efb5d","ja":"ほら、全国ツアーのわたしたちのステージ、\nすっごく盛り上がったじゃないですか？","zh":"你看，全国巡演时我们的舞台，气氛不是特别热烈吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_900.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"844ac19e5446e6b4264cf14001afe9701230058d260e4cd7225eecf3c1a2db09","ja":"それなのに、まだ打ち上げとか\n全然してないんですよ～。","zh":"明明是这样，却还完全没办庆功宴之类的呢～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_900.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"d995e61495a013b0de0edeeb9ccf173e627f4ce4a697cc499345e78c2cc54bc0","ja":"あ～、なるほど！　そっか。\nあれから結構バタバタしちゃってたもんね。","zh":"啊～，原来如此！这样啊。\n从那之后确实一直挺忙乱的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_900.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"dfebdae5ba443d97572c16ec674c038102fcac4764f57b32599f7fd4dcd9a682","ja":"アタシもみんなと話したいし、\n翼、ナイスアイディア！","zh":"我也想和大家聊聊，翼，这主意不错！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_900.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"a22dfe65cf54d7ead0177ddf70880924ab30415775b28f00cbc3c39569220af7","ja":"わ～い♪　それじゃあ、まつりさんと\n貴音さんを誘って、買い出しに行きましょ～！","zh":"好耶♪ 那就叫上茉莉和贵音，一起去采购吧～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_900.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"c056e54f78c7e40a4e871212753d2a09f49915c5e73e5467a1a75395adf861db","ja":"え、ちょっと待ってよ翼、早いって～！\n楽しみなのはわかったからさ～！","zh":"诶，等一下啦，翼，你也太快了～！\n我知道你很期待啦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
